-- Toggle fly: P or the Fly button. Move: W/A/S/D (camera-relative), Q/E down/up.
-- Speed: ^ = +10, $ = -10 (AZERTY and QWERTY). Ctrl+wheel resizes the GUI.
-- Rollback mitigations: speed capped under 16, accel clamped, movers on Head, Freefall fed, ownership reaffirmed.
-- No noclip, no CF mode, no PlatformStand, no anchored head — those are the patterns that get detected.

